  "description": "Soohyeon’s peaceful life in the countryside, running a quaint general store and tending a garden, is upended when rumors spread of a luxury hotel project—and the arrival of Taeyeon, a gruff yet oddly charming director from S.W. Construction who looks more like a mob boss than a businessman. Despite warnings from the village grandmas to steer clear, Soohyeon isn’t intimidated, even as Taeyeon’s attempts to “bribe” him with sweet treats start melting his defenses. But when an unexpected moment reveals Soohyeon’s biggest secret, what starts as a clash of personalities turns into a tangled mix of sweetness, spice, and chaos that neither of them saw coming.\n\n_Source: Lezhin US_",
